---
// Static editorial page — brand-level promise framing.
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Aspire Promise — Aspire Sports"
  description="The Aspire Promise: what we commit to every player and every family — coaching standards, fair refunds, schedule integrity, inclusive play."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="bg-cream">
    {/* Hero */}
    <section class="relative pt-24 pb-12 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-16">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-6 border-b border-ink/15 mb-12">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-ink-muted">
            Aspire Sports · Central Ohio
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-ink-muted hidden sm:inline">
            The Promise
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block w-8 h-px bg-primary-orange"></span>
          What we commit to
        </p>

        <h1
          class="font-display text-ink leading-tight mb-8"
          style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em;"
        >
          The Aspire <span class="italic text-primary-orange">Promise.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Every family and every adult player who registers with Aspire is owed a clear set
          of commitments. This is what we hold ourselves to — and what to do if we ever fall short.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Promise tiles */}
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ① Coaching standards
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Coaches who earned the right.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Every coach has a real playing résumé and is trained in our development frameworks
              (Double-Goal Coach, ELM, TDEQ-5). Not parent volunteers filling a clipboard.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ② Fair refunds
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">No surprise penalties.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Full refunds 14+ days before a season starts. Prorated credits or refunds after that
              for legitimate reasons — injury, relocation, family emergency. We don't hide behind
              fine print.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ③ Schedule integrity
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">If we cancel, you're made whole.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Programs we cancel for any reason — facility loss, insufficient enrollment, weather,
              staffing — get prorated credits or full refunds. Within 10 business days.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ④ Inclusive play
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Every player gets coached.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              No bench-warmers as a coaching strategy. We run programs where every registered
              player gets developmental attention and meaningful playing time at their level.
              See our <a href="/community/inclusion" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">inclusion principles</a>
              and <a href="/community/sportsmanship" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">code of conduct</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ⑤ Honest catalog
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">No phantom programs.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Every program in the catalog is real, scheduled, and has confirmed coaches and
              facilities. If we cannot run it as listed, we tell you before you pay — not after.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
              ⑥ One platform, full lifecycle
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">From U6 to adult, on one account.</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Your registration history, your kid's program history, your adult-league rosters —
              all on one Aspire account. Sports don't end at 18, and neither does your data.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* If something goes wrong */}
    <section class="bg-cream-2 py-16 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-ink mb-6">
          If we ever fall short.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-3xl mb-6">
          Email <a href="mailto:hello@aspiresportsohio.com" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">hello@aspiresportsohio.com</a>
          with what happened and what would make it right. We respond within one business day,
          and a real person — not a ticket queue — owns your case until it's resolved.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-sm">
          For the full mechanics of refunds, credits, and timelines, see the
          <a href="/refund-policy" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">refund policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
